        "text_SOwCLfSLJeD9INt0": "<p>Lio’s flavoured air provides a subtle, natural taste designed to help you quit smoking or vaping. </p><p></p><p>It’s less intense than vapor but refreshing, similar to a lightly infused herbal tea or soda without the sweetness.</p>",
