        "text_igyNmmfaZXNWJ9YY": "<p>If you’ve used Lio™, commit to a 30 days to experience its benefits. After completing the 30-day journey, you have 7 days to request a refund if you’re not satisfied. This ensures you have enough time to fully explore its impact before making a decision.</p>",
        "text_CxynOg6DlNrqGgvO": "<p><strong>Shipping &amp; Refunds</strong></p>",
        "text_pm0Y2SWb4aUE7qhy": "<p>We ship worldwide for free from the Netherlands!</p><p></p><p>Delivery takes <strong>2-3 days within Europe</strong>, <strong>3-4 days to the UK</strong>, <strong>4-8 days outside Europe</strong>, and <strong>next-day delivery in the Middle East</strong> (from Dubai). </p><p></p><p>Enjoy fast, reliable shipping at no extra cost.</p>",
        "text_8YTI8K10zo72OxgB": "<p><strong>Is Lio safe?</strong></p>",
        "text_MRCal2XvqCp4oSyZ": "<p><strong>Absolutely!</strong> Lio is made from 100% natural ingredients, including essential oils, plant extracts, and natural flavors. It’s completely free of nicotine, chemicals, or harmful toxins, making it a safe, clean alternative to smoking and vaping.</p>",
        "text_o2oOj9kWneot2jIZ": "<p><strong>How long do Flavour Cores last?</strong></p>",
        "text_DMlepXKJcdzfcxVZ": "<p>Each Flavour Core is designed to last up to <strong>2 to 3 days</strong> with regular use, depending on how often you use your Lio. A pack of six cores provides enough flavour for <strong>60 days</strong>.</p>",
        "text_HOVbKX0Er4MCsYTb": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio?</strong></p>",
        "text_yAzTC4K4JAe8b7X1": "<p>You can use Lio as often as you like. It’s completely natural and free of nicotine, smoke, or vapor, so there’s no harm in frequent use.</p>",
