        "text_maAqJC3sKxRoOOSm": "<h3>\"The diffuser that’s transforming the way people quit smoking &amp; vaping for good.\"</h3>",
        "text_yE0L3qPW4G7yLocO": "<p>Quitting smoking or vaping isn’t easy, but Lio simplifies it by focusing on what truly works.</p><p></p><p>Unlike other solutions that rely on nicotine or chemicals, Lio helps you <strong>curb cravings naturally</strong> while preserving the familiar<strong> hand-to-mouth habit</strong>.</p><p></p><p>No need for cold turkey or frustration with methods that fall short.</p><p></p><p>With Lio, you get a <strong>natural</strong>, <strong>stress-free way</strong> to break free—without side effects.</p><p></p><p>It’s a tool designed to support your journey, making quitting feel achievable and empowering every step of the way.</p>",
